 "labels": [
  {
   "language": "en",
   "status": "official",
   "text": "Section 55(d)(1)(B): the AMT exemption amount for an individual who is not a married individual and not a surviving spouse. Statutory $50,600 (2012 base); section 55(d)(4)(A)(i)(II) substitutes $70,300 for taxable years beginning after 2017; 2025 and 2026 are the Revenue Procedure figures. Years between the anchored rows are NOT pinned in this package (no Revenue Procedure text for them is in us.irc.inflation_adjustments): evaluation returns MISSING_PARAMETER_VALUE there instead of a fabricated indexed figure (TECH-GAPS, income-individual stage 2 AMT)."
  }
 ],
